# ai-video-platform — Project Rules

- Build only the step I ask for. Never implement future steps.
- Never hardcode secrets, DB URLs or API keys. Use `.env` and provide `.env.example`.
- Never store video/audio/image files in MongoDB. MongoDB is for metadata/state only.
- Frontend: React + TypeScript (strict) + Vite. Backend: Python 3.11+, FastAPI.
- Keep API contracts stable; if a change is required, update frontend types too.
- After every task: run build/lint/tests and fix all errors before finishing.
- Prefer small reusable modules, typed code, no dead code.
